Greetings, Warlords!

We will conduct maintenance updates during the following:
APAC: November 7, 14:00-17:00 (UTC+8)
EU/AMS: November 7, 7:00-10:00 (UTC+1)
The maintenance is expected to last for 3 hours. After the maintenance, we will distribute Bronze Coins*8000, Honor*300, and Unit Medal*15 as compensation. Warlords, please arrange your playtime accordingly. 
The update will contain the following:
 
I. Events

1. Limited-time Doctrine Pool Rotation

Info:
[Windswept Plain] is open now in [X] - [War Scholar]. There is an increased chance to find Epic Infantry Doctrines including [Devastation] and [Epic Combat Doctrine] at this location.
Time:
11/7 after maintenance - 11/21 before maintenance.
 
II. Bugs Fixed and Optimizations

Fixed the issue where [Swinefeathers] cannot equip [Epic Arquebus Doctrine IV];

Fixed the issue where when exchanging items or previewing boxes, pressing [ESC] cannot close the interface;

Fixed the issue where [Siphonarioi] cannot activate the limited-time Leadership-reduction Doctrine of the Lionfire season;

Fixed the issue where the standby special effect of the legendary poleaxe attire [Destiny Judgment] is incorrect;

Fixed the issue where the "+" status does not update after filling in the maximum value when purchasing items in the shop;

Fixed the issue where the missing kits of the units carried out of the city can be replenished through U - [Reinforce] in the big world. The kits of the units carried out can only be replenished in the main city of the region, the Trade Colonies, and the fiefs occupied by your alliance;

Optimized the selection logic of U - [Reinforce]. Now [Auxiliaries] will not be replenished together.

