Greetings Warlords,

In the update of this week, we have made balance adjustments to the Men-at-Arms and Spear Sergeants which caused dramatic changes in player experience, and we realize that those changes were quite extreme. We appreciate the time investment of every player who is devoted to our game, so we decided to commit to the following:

• Starting from this balance adjustment, when there are necessary adjustments to unit that require dramatic nerfs in order to keep a balanced ecosystem we will give our warlords Doctrine Water that can remove Doctrines and Scroll of Forgetfulness that can return manuals for free;

Developers' thoughts on the combat balance:

• We pay attention to the balance and will promptly adjust the factors that affect it. We will compensate everyone's investment in Doctrines and Manuals as well;
• At the same time, we will also control the cycle of changes in the battle environment and not make large balance changes too fast.

Adjustments for this week:

• This weekend, we will open the activity of removing Doctrines for free, and you can adjust the Doctrines of the units according to your preferences;
• The item of returning Manual is developed urgently and the item for the units that are influenced due to the balance changes will be given away after the update on September 21.

