We will update the game during our maintenance on April 28th, which will last for 3 hours and run between 12:30-15:30 (UTC+8). After the maintenance, we will give all players 8,000 Bronze Coins, 300 Honor, and 15 Unit Medals as compensation for any inconvenience caused. Be sure to arrange your time accordingly. 

* The [Espada Forest] server will be undergoing maintenance on April 28 as we're performing network debugging. We estimate the maintenance will take 6.5 hours and run between 12:30-19:00 (UTC+8). After the maintenance we will give players 16,000 Bronze Coins, 600 Honor, and 30 Unit Medals as compensation for any inconvenience caused. Be sure to arrange your time accordingly.

